cogwork.film.shaft = Torque shafts take its power to the assembly benches
cogwork.film.bench = which craft from the patterns laid in them
cogwork.film.sorting = A sorting tube sends each kind its own way
cogwork.film.dig = The same power drives an excavator down, layer by layer
